                    geometryDescEl.textContent = `You are actively comparing three distinct chemical architectures side-by-side. Notice the fundamental differences in geometric dimensionality: from 1D linear chains and 2D planar rings to 3D puckered crowns and infinite crystalline lattices.`;
                    combustionDescEl.textContent = `Use the bottom controls to toggle between Ball & Stick and Space-Filling (vdW) modes. Transitioning to Space-Filling mode visually demonstrates how packing density and steric bulk dictate reactivity, ignition sensitivity, and detonation velocity in energetic materials.`;
